{"product_id":"hamlyn-all-colour-cookbook","title":"Hamlyn All Colour Cookbook","description":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone enjoys a fancy tipple from time to time, whether partying among friends or taking a moment alone to relax, but sometimes you need more than just a rum \u0026amp; coke. This book provides you with 200 recipes to create the perfect drink for any ocassion, from a minty Mojito or classic Margarita to a sophisticated Champagne Cocktail or exotic Russian Spring Punch. With full-page colour photographs and easy-to-follow recipes, Hamlyn All Colour Cookbook: 200 Cocktails is the essential guide to impressing your guests and making your drinks toast of the town.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 166\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Hamlyn Books | Octopus Publishing Group\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780600610205\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45905858101401,"sku":"12RD9780600610205","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691a02c7a6bde_Hamlyn_All_Colour_Cookbook.jpg?v=1763396479","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/hamlyn-all-colour-cookbook","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}